# Veripsa release gate (auto-discovered). One gate per file -> two PRs adding gates add two FILES, never a
# shared line -> no false merge conflict on registration. register_gate is defined in run_gates.sh.
# Format: register_gate <test> <marker> <name> <ok_blurb> <desc> [tail]
register_gate "tests/test_resolve_scoped_monorepo.py" "SCOPED-MONOREPO GATE: PASS" "Scoped monorepo import resolution: @scope/pkg workspace packages resolve to local files" "Scoped workspace package imports resolve: 699 cross-package edges on NestJS monorepo (0 before fix), 0 false edges to external packages." "JS/TS monorepos (NestJS/nx/Turborepo/Lerna) declare workspace packages with scoped names (@scope/pkg) in packages/*/package.json. An import of @scope/pkg/subpath inside the same repo is a LOCAL cross-package dependency that the resolver previously skipped (the @ guard in _own_packages blocked ALL scoped imports). Fix: _scoped_workspace_pkg_map reads package.json files under packages/*, libs/*, apps/*, modules/*, projects/* for name fields starting with @, builds a scoped-name to src-dir map, and resolves @scope/pkg[/subpath] imports when the target subpath maps to a real local file (precision guard). External deps not declared locally stay unresolved. BEFORE: ~0 resolved @nestjs/* imports on NestJS monorepo. AFTER: 699 cross-package edges from 562 files, 0 false external edges. Synthetic test: @org/core in packages/core resolves from packages/app; @other/lib not in local package.json stays unresolved; libs/* layout also works; malformed package.json is skipped without crash." 10
